  "name": "Request for Student Educational Record (Transcript)",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of The Request for Student Educational Record (Transcript) Transaction Set (146) within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set is used by educational institutions to which a student has applied for admission. This request is then sent to the educational institution which the student is currently attending or previously attended.",
